<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS - AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES - Tenders total A$40 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS - AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES - Tenders total A$40 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lend Lease Corp was the only issuer to hold a p-note tender on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The property development, funds management, building and civil engineering group sold A$40 million worth of its 30-day paper at about two basis points over the corresponding bank bill mid rate.</p>
<p>An early pull-back in the long end of the debt curve in preparation for the A$700 million Treasury bond tender pushed physical bill prices a touch lower over the morning.</p>
<p>At 0222 GMT (12.22 p.m.), December bill futures were down 0.03 to 93.32, a point above their intraday low.</p>
